title: "repository-knowledge-audit: kblint + 54-task convention-conflict benchmark + analyses"
abstract: "Deterministic claim-level audit of repository knowledge for coding agents: kblint rules R1-R9, a 54-task constructed convention-conflict benchmark with hidden pytest grading, and frozen analyses (entry/two-sided effects, evidence competition, mixed packs, real-repository audit, PR replay, and the maintainer workflow)."
